    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Authority stays in the economy","items":["Claims, reservations, pending work and recovery obligations use assets and exchanges.","Scores and search frontiers remain decision evidence.","The kernel evaluates; the coordinator owns persistence and publication."]},
    {"dot":"amber","title":"Three levels of execution","items":["Exchange: one domain law applied atomically.","Atomic group: ordered valid exchanges published all-or-nothing.","Behavior: multiple groups, observations and external work; recovery is explicit."]},
